<div class="container about">

    <div class="row">

        <div class="col-md-6">
            <img src="./images/police-dog.jpg" class="dogWorksPicture" alt="dog picture 1">
        </div>

        <div class="col-md-4 text">
            <p>Most people think of their dogs as companions, pets or even furry children. However dogs have been
                “employed” in a large
                variety of fields! These working canines certainly deserve recognition, as they have earned their
                treats. Weather they
                were helping humans, hunting or entertaining, dogs have held jobs for centuries. Most breeds were
                created for the
                express purpose of performing a task – even if that task is cuddling! Check out this list of jobs that
                dogs have
                performed!</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

